    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2CgNYHWQV1wAe7GdaVySBMU)_\n\nThe saved views file `sp-collection-query-tables-views.el` now defaults to `sp-etc-dir` (`var/etc/`, the folder for kept, non-regenerated files, the nearest thing here to an XDG config folder) instead of `user-emacs-directory`.\n\n- Migration: while the new file does not exist, the file in `user-emacs-directory` is read, then the pre-rename `sp-vulpea-table-views.el`; the next save writes the new location. Old files are left in place.\n- Updated the literate doc (code, Saved views intro, rename section, Changes by pull request) and the tangled `.el`.\n- Not run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAFeBHXwnvA4c3CGSx)_",
